Every duloxetine has a fibromyalgia-FDA-approval.
Every milnacipran has a fibromyalgia-FDA-approval.
Every pregabalin has a fibromyalgia-FDA-approval.
If a patient has a fibromyalgia then every clinician should consider a duloxetine for the fibromyalgia.
If a patient has a fibromyalgia then every clinician should consider a milnacipran for the fibromyalgia.
If a patient has a fibromyalgia then every clinician should consider a pregabalin for the fibromyalgia.
